{
  "string": {
    "ConfirmationText": "Obrigado pelo seu interesse em {name}. Para completar o processo de registo, copie o seguinte link na barra de URL do seu navegador: {link}. Cumprimentos, equipa {name}.",
    "ConfirmationHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Olá,</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Obrigado pelo seu interesse em {name}. Para completar o processo de registo, siga <a href=\"{link}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#18181B;text-decoration:underline\">este link</a> ou copie o seguinte link na barra de URL do seu navegador.</p><p style=\"margin:16px 0 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#A1A1AA;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"{link}\" style=\"color:#71717A;word-break:break-all;text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px\">{link}</a></p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:28px\"><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #F4F4F5;padding-top:24px\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.5;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Cumprimentos,<br>Equipa {name}.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "ConfirmationSubject": "Confirme o seu endereço de email para registar-se em {name}",
    "RecoveryText": "Recebemos um pedido para repor a senha da sua conta. Para repor a sua senha, cole o seguinte link na barra de endereço do seu navegador web: {link}. Se não solicitou a recuperação da senha, ignore esta mensagem.",
    "RecoveryHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 28px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Recebemos um pedido para repor a senha da sua conta. Para repor a sua senha, clique no link abaixo:</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:8px\"><a href=\"{link}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:13px 26px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:-0.1px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Repor senha &rarr;</a></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:28px 0 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#A1A1AA;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Se o link Repor senha acima não funcionar, cole o seguinte link na barra de endereço do seu navegador web:<br><a href=\"{link}\" style=\"color:#71717A;word-break:break-all;text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px\">{link}</a></p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:28px\"><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #F4F4F5;padding-top:24px\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.5;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Se não solicitou a recuperação da senha, ignore esta mensagem.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "RecoverySubject": "Recuperação de Senha",
    "InviteText": "Foi convidado para {ws}. Para se juntar, cole o seguinte link na barra de URL do seu navegador web: {link}. Link válido por {expHours} horas.",
    "InviteHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 28px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Foi convidado para <b>{ws}</b>. Para se juntar, clique no link abaixo:</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:8px\"><a href=\"{link}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:13px 26px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:-0.1px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Juntar-se &rarr;</a></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:28px 0 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#A1A1AA;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Se o link de convite acima não funcionar, cole o seguinte link na barra de URL do seu navegador web:<br><a href=\"{link}\" style=\"color:#71717A;word-break:break-all;text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px\">{link}</a></p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:28px\"><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #F4F4F5;padding-top:24px\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.5;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Link válido por {expHours} horas.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "InviteSubject": "Convite para {ws}",
    "OtpText": "Confirme o seu endereço de email para aceder a {app}!\n\nO seu código de confirmação está abaixo - introduza-o na janela onde começou a iniciar sessão para {app}.\n\n{code}\n\nSe não solicitou este email, não há motivo para preocupação - pode ignorá-lo com segurança.",
    "OtpHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><h1 style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#18181B;letter-spacing:-0.4px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.3\">Confirme o seu endereço de email para aceder a {app}!</h1><p style=\"margin:0 0 28px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">O seu código de confirmação está abaixo - introduza-o na janela onde começou a iniciar sessão para {app}.</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"background-color:#FAFAFA;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-radius:8px;padding:20px 24px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:36px;font-weight:700;color:#18181B;letter-spacing:6px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{code}</span></td></tr></table><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:28px\"><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #F4F4F5;padding-top:24px\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.5;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Se não solicitou este email, não há motivo para preocupação - pode ignorá-lo com segurança.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "SignUpOtpText": "Confirme o seu endereço de email para aceder a {app}!\n\nO seu código de confirmação está abaixo - introduza-o na janela onde começou o registo em {app}.\n\n{code}\n\nO código é válido apenas durante alguns minutos. Se expirou ou fechou a janela, abra esta ligação para concluir o registo:\n{link}\n\nSe não solicitou este email, não há motivo para preocupação - pode ignorá-lo com segurança.",
    "SignUpOtpHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><h1 style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#18181B;letter-spacing:-0.4px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.3\">Confirme o seu endereço de email para aceder a {app}!</h1><p style=\"margin:0 0 28px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">O seu código de confirmação está abaixo - introduza-o na janela onde começou o registo em {app}.</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"background-color:#FAFAFA;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-radius:8px;padding:20px 24px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:36px;font-weight:700;color:#18181B;letter-spacing:6px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{code}</span></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:28px 0 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#A1A1AA;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">O código é válido apenas durante alguns minutos. Se expirou ou fechou a janela, <a href=\"{link}\" style=\"color:#71717A;text-decoration:underline\">conclua o registo com esta ligação</a>.<br><a href=\"{link}\" style=\"color:#71717A;word-break:break-all;text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px\">{link}</a></p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:28px\"><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #F4F4F5;padding-top:24px\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.5;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Se não solicitou este email, não há motivo para preocupação - pode ignorá-lo com segurança.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "OtpSubject": "Código de confirmação {app}: {code}",
    "ResendInviteText": "Você foi reinvitado para {ws}. Por favor, use o link a seguir para se juntar: {link}. O link de reinvitação é válido por {expHours} horas.",
    "ResendInviteHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 28px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Você foi reinvitado para <b>{ws}</b>. Para se juntar, clique no link abaixo:</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:8px\"><a href=\"{link}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:13px 26px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:-0.1px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Entrar &rarr;</a></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:28px 0 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#A1A1AA;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Se o link de convite acima não funcionar, cole o seguinte link na barra de URL do seu navegador:<br><a href=\"{link}\" style=\"color:#71717A;word-break:break-all;text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px\">{link}</a></p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:28px\"><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #F4F4F5;padding-top:24px\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.5;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">O link de reinvitação é válido por {expHours} horas.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "ResendInviteSubject": "Reconvite para {ws}",
    "AdminOtpSubject": "Confirmation code for an administrator action",
    "AdminOtpText": "You are about to perform a sensitive administrator action in {app} (deleting/archiving a workspace, changing members or a subscription, renaming a URL, or deleting an account).\n\nYour confirmation code is:\n\n{code}\n\nEnter it in the admin panel to confirm. If you did not initiate this action, do NOT share this code and review your account security.",
    "AdminOtpHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">You are about to perform a sensitive administrator action in <b>{app}</b> (deleting/archiving a workspace, changing members or a subscription, renaming a URL, or deleting an account).</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Your confirmation code is:</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"background-color:#FAFAFA;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-radius:8px;padding:20px 24px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:36px;font-weight:700;color:#18181B;letter-spacing:6px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{code}</span></td></tr></table><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:28px\"><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #F4F4F5;padding-top:24px\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.5;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Enter it in the admin panel to confirm. If you did not initiate this action, do NOT share this code and review your account security.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "OperationOtpSubject": "Código de confirmação de uma ação no {app}",
    "OperationOtpText": "Pediu para sair de um espaço de trabalho, eliminar um espaço de trabalho ou eliminar a sua conta no {app}.\n\nO seu código de confirmação é:\n\n{code}\n\nIntroduza-o na janela onde iniciou esta ação. Se não foi você a pedir isto, não partilhe o código com ninguém e verifique a segurança da sua conta.",
    "OperationOtpHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Pediu para sair de um espaço de trabalho, eliminar um espaço de trabalho ou eliminar a sua conta no <b>{app}</b>.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">O seu código de confirmação é:</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"background-color:#FAFAFA;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-radius:8px;padding:20px 24px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:36px;font-weight:700;color:#18181B;letter-spacing:6px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{code}</span></td></tr></table><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:28px\"><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #F4F4F5;padding-top:24px\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.5;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Introduza-o na janela onde iniciou esta ação. Se não foi você a pedir isto, não partilhe o código com ninguém e verifique a segurança da sua conta.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "WorkspaceDeletionScheduledSubject": "O espaço de trabalho {ws} está agendado para eliminação",
    "WorkspaceDeletionScheduledText": "O espaço de trabalho {ws} ({url}) será eliminado em {date}. {readonlyDays, plural, =0 {} one {Continua aberto apenas de leitura por mais # dia para que os dados possam ser retirados. } other {Continua aberto apenas de leitura por mais # dias para que os dados possam ser retirados. }}Depois é arquivado, e nessa data ele e a sua cópia de segurança desaparecem definitivamente. Até lá, qualquer proprietário pode cancelar a eliminação: {link}",
    "WorkspaceDeletionScheduledHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">O espaço de trabalho <b>{ws}</b> ({url}) será eliminado em <b>{date}</b>.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{readonlyDays, plural, =0 {} one {Continua aberto apenas de leitura por mais # dia para que os dados possam ser retirados. } other {Continua aberto apenas de leitura por mais # dias para que os dados possam ser retirados. }}Depois é arquivado, e nessa data ele e a sua cópia de segurança desaparecem definitivamente.</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Até lá, qualquer proprietário pode cancelar a eliminação: <a href=\"{link}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#18181B;word-break:break-all;text-decoration:underline\">{link}</a></p></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "WorkspaceDeletedSubject": "O espaço de trabalho {ws} está a ser eliminado",
    "WorkspaceDeletedText": "O espaço de trabalho {ws} ({url}) está a ser eliminado agora, sem o prazo habitual. Os dados e a cópia de segurança não podem ser recuperados.",
    "WorkspaceDeletedHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">O espaço de trabalho <b>{ws}</b> ({url}) está a ser eliminado agora, sem o prazo habitual.</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Os dados e a cópia de segurança não podem ser recuperados.</p></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "AccountDeletionScheduledSubject": "A sua conta está agendada para eliminação",
    "AccountDeletionScheduledText": "A sua conta será eliminada em {date}. Se iniciar sessão antes dessa data, pode cancelar: {link}",
    "AccountDeletionScheduledHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">A sua conta será eliminada em <b>{date}</b>.</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Se iniciar sessão antes dessa data, pode cancelar: <a href=\"{link}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#18181B;word-break:break-all;text-decoration:underline\">{link}</a></p></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "AccountDeletedSubject": "A sua conta foi eliminada",
    "AccountDeletedText": "A sua conta foi eliminada. Tudo o que o identificava desapareceu e o endereço fica livre para um novo registo.",
    "AccountDeletedHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">A sua conta foi eliminada.</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Tudo o que o identificava desapareceu e o endereço fica livre para um novo registo.</p></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "AccountDeletionCancelledSubject": "A sua conta {app} está novamente ativa",
    "AccountDeletionCancelledText": "A eliminação da sua conta {app} foi cancelada - a conta está novamente ativa.\n\nObrigado por continuar connosco!\n\nOs espaços de trabalho que enviou para eliminação continuam agendados - cada um tem de ser restaurado separadamente: {link}",
    "AccountDeletionCancelledHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">A eliminação da sua conta <b>{app}</b> foi cancelada - a conta está novamente ativa.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Obrigado por continuar connosco!</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Os espaços de trabalho que enviou para eliminação continuam agendados - cada um tem de ser restaurado separadamente: <a href=\"{link}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#18181B;word-break:break-all;text-decoration:underline\">{link}</a></p></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "WorkspaceDeletionCancelledSubject": "O espaço de trabalho {ws} não será eliminado",
    "WorkspaceDeletionCancelledText": "A eliminação do espaço de trabalho {ws} ({url}) foi cancelada. {state, select, archived {Já foi arquivado - qualquer proprietário pode restaurá-lo: {link}} restoring {Está a ser restaurado a partir do arquivo e estará disponível novamente em breve: {link}} other {Está totalmente disponível novamente: {link}}}\n\nObrigado por continuar connosco!",
    "WorkspaceDeletionCancelledHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">A eliminação do espaço de trabalho <b>{ws}</b> ({url}) foi cancelada.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{state, select, archived {Já foi arquivado - qualquer proprietário pode restaurá-lo: <a href=\"{link}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#18181B;word-break:break-all;text-decoration:underline\">{link}</a>} restoring {Está a ser restaurado a partir do arquivo e estará disponível novamente em breve: <a href=\"{link}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#18181B;word-break:break-all;text-decoration:underline\">{link}</a>} other {Está totalmente disponível novamente: <a href=\"{link}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#18181B;word-break:break-all;text-decoration:underline\">{link}</a>}}</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Obrigado por continuar connosco!</p></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>"
  }
